# Manual checks with the JetBrains HTTP client or the Visual Studio Code REST Client.
# Change the variables below to target another host or port.
@baseUrl = https://localhost
@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1

# @name checkSystemStatus
### Health check (V1)
GET {{apiUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

# @name openApiSpec
### OpenAPI specification
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/docs
Accept: application/vnd.openapi+json
